---
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>정민 세무회계 — 세무사 사무소</title>
  <meta name="description" content="정민 세무회계 사무소 안내 — 종합소득세·법인세·양도소득세·기장대리. 서울 강남구. 1960년대 정부 정책 백서 양식." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@300;400;500;600;700;900&family=Libre+Baskerville:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

    :root {
      --paper: #eae6db;
      --paper-deep: #e2ddcf;
      --paper-edge: #d8d2c2;
      --ink: #2a2a28;
      --ink-soft: #4a463f;
      --ink-faint: #6f6a5e;
      --navy: #2c3a52;
      --navy-deep: #1f2a3c;
      --seal: #8c3b2e;
      --rule: #2a2a28;
      --hair: #b7b0a0;
      --shadow: rgba(40, 36, 28, 0.16);
      --serif: 'Noto Serif KR', 'Libre Baskerville', serif;
      --latin: 'Libre Baskerville', 'Noto Serif KR', serif;
    }

    html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 31px, rgba(120, 110, 90, 0.04) 31px, rgba(120, 110, 90, 0.04) 32px),
        var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.95;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      font-size: 16px;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .latin { font-family: var(--latin); letter-spacing: 0.02em; }

    /* ── 문서 프레임 ─────────────────────────── */
    .document {
      max-width: 880px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 clamp(18px, 5vw, 56px) 120px;
      background: var(--paper);
      background-image:
        repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 31px, rgba(120, 110, 90, 0.045) 31px, rgba(120, 110, 90, 0.045) 32px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--paper-edge), 0 18px 60px -30px var(--shadow);
      position: relative;
    }
    .document::before,
    .document::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; bottom: 0;
      width: 1px;
      background: rgba(120,110,90,0.22);
    }
    .document::before { left: clamp(10px, 3vw, 30px); }
    .document::after { right: clamp(10px, 3vw, 30px); }

    /* ── 상단 분류표시 띠 ───────────────────── */
    .classmark {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding: 10px 4px 9px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--latin);
      font-size: 11.5px;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
    }
    .classmark .docno { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
    .classmark .grade {
      border: 1px solid var(--ink);
      padding: 2px 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    /* ── 표지 ───────────────────────────────── */
    .cover {
      padding: clamp(44px, 9vw, 96px) 0 clamp(40px, 7vw, 72px);
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 3px double var(--ink);
    }
    .cover .issuer {
      font-family: var(--latin);
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-faint);
      margin: 0 0 30px;
      padding-left: 0.5em;
    }
    .cover h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 9vw, 4.6rem);
      line-height: 1.12;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .cover h1 .en {
      display: block;
      font-family: var(--latin);
      font-weight: 400;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 3.2vw, 1.25rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-top: 22px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .cover .slogan {
      margin: 34px auto 0;
      max-width: 30ch;
      font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 2.4vw, 1.18rem);
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      line-height: 1.85;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .cover .rule-pair {
      width: 120px;
      margin: 30px auto 0;
      border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
      height: 5px;
    }

    /* 표지 발행 정보 표 */
    .cover-meta {
      margin: clamp(40px, 7vw, 64px) auto 0;
      max-width: 460px;
      border: 2px solid var(--ink);
      font-size: 13.5px;
    }
    .cover-meta dl {
      margin: 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 38% 62%;
    }
    .cover-meta dt, .cover-meta dd {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 9px 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);
      text-align: left;
    }
    .cover-meta dt {
      background: var(--paper-deep);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--ink);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
    }
    .cover-meta dd { letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
    .cover-meta dl:last-child dt,
    .cover-meta dl:last-child dd { border-bottom: none; }

    /* ── 목차 ───────────────────────────────── */
    .toc {
      margin: clamp(40px, 7vw, 64px) 0 0;
      padding: 28px clamp(8px, 3vw, 30px) 30px;
      border: 1px solid var(--ink);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.22);
    }
    .toc h2 {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.5em;
      padding-left: 0.5em;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .toc ol { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; counter-reset: toc; }
    .toc li {
      counter-increment: toc;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 7px 4px;
      font-size: 14.5px;
    }
    .toc li .chap {
      font-family: var(--latin);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--navy);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .toc li .lead {
      border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--hair);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      min-width: 16px;
    }
    .toc li .pg { font-family: var(--latin); color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 13px; }
    .toc a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    .toc a:hover .title { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

    /* ── 장(章) 섹션 ────────────────────────── */
    .chapter { margin-top: clamp(54px, 9vw, 88px); }
    .chapter-head {
      border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
      padding: 14px 4px 12px;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }
    .chapter-head .kicker {
      font-family: var(--latin);
      font-size: 11.5px;
      letter-spacing: 0.34em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--navy);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .chapter-head h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4.6vw, 2.05rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .chapter-head .sub {
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--ink-faint);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    /* 조항형 문단 */
    .article {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 18px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);
    }
    .article:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .article .no {
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--navy-deep);
      white-space: nowrap;
      padding-top: 1px;
    }
    .article .body { margin: 0; }
    .article .body strong { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
    .article .body p { margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .article .body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .article .clause {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 6px;
      padding-left: 1.4em;
      text-indent: -1.4em;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
    }
    .article .clause::before {
      content: attr(data-n);
      display: inline-block;
      width: 1.4em;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-family: var(--latin);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* ── 괘선표 ─────────────────────────────── */
    .ledger { margin: 6px 0 4px; overflow-x: auto; }
    table.gov {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 14px;
      border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    }
    table.gov caption {
      caption-side: top;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      padding: 0 0 9px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    table.gov thead th {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--paper);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-right: 1px solid rgba(234,230,219,0.3);
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    table.gov thead th:last-child { border-right: none; }
    table.gov tbody th {
      text-align: left;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: var(--paper-deep);
      color: var(--ink);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    table.gov td, table.gov tbody th {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--hair);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--hair);
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    table.gov td:last-child, table.gov tbody th:last-child { border-right: none; }
    table.gov tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.28); }
    table.gov .num { font-family: var(--latin); text-align: right; letter-spacing: 0.03em; white-space: nowrap; }
    table.gov tfoot td {
      border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
      font-weight: 700;
      background: var(--paper-deep);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    /* ── 약력(연표형) ───────────────────────── */
    .vitae {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      gap: 0 24px;
    }
    .vitae .yr {
      font-family: var(--latin);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .vitae .ev {
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);
      margin: 0;
    }
    .vitae .yr:last-of-type, .vitae .ev:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }
    .vitae-name {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      padding-bottom: 16px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    }
    .vitae-name .nm { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
    .vitae-name .lic { font-family: var(--latin); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--ink-faint); }

    /* ── 절차 단계 ──────────────────────────── */
    .steps { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; counter-reset: step; }
    .steps li {
      counter-increment: step;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);
      align-items: start;
    }
    .steps li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .steps li::before {
      content: counter(step, decimal-leading-zero);
      font-family: var(--latin);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy);
      line-height: 1;
      padding-top: 2px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--navy);
    }
    .steps h3 { margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: 1.08rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    .steps p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 14.5px; }

    /* 별표 주석 */
    .footnote {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--hair);
      font-size: 12.5px;
      line-height: 1.85;
      color: var(--ink-faint);
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }
    .footnote p { margin: 0 0 5px; padding-left: 1.5em; text-indent: -1.5em; }
    .footnote .star { color: var(--seal); font-weight: 700; }

    /* ── 상담 신청 CTA ──────────────────────── */
    .cta {
      margin-top: clamp(54px, 9vw, 88px);
      border: 2px solid var(--ink);
      position: relative;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    }
    .cta-head {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 24px 24px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
      position: relative;
    }
    .cta-head .kicker {
      font-family: var(--latin);
      font-size: 11.5px;
      letter-spacing: 0.34em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--navy);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .cta-head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 2.1rem); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
    .cta-head p { margin: 12px auto 0; max-width: 34ch; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 14.5px; }

    .cta-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .cta-grid > div { padding: 26px clamp(18px, 4vw, 32px); }
    .cta-grid > div:first-child { border-right: 1px solid var(--ink); }
    .cta-grid h3 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: var(--navy);
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);
    }
    .contact-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 6px 16px; font-size: 14.5px; }
    .contact-row dt { color: var(--ink-faint); letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
    .contact-row dd { margin: 0; font-family: var(--latin); letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
    .contact-row dd.ko { font-family: var(--serif); }

    /* 약도(텍스트/CSS) */
    .map {
      margin-top: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--ink);
      background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 9px, rgba(44,58,82,0.05) 9px, rgba(44,58,82,0.05) 10px),
        var(--paper-deep);
      padding: 16px;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
    }
    .map .pin { color: var(--seal); font-weight: 700; }
    .map .axis {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--hair);
      font-family: var(--latin);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .apply-btn {
      display: block;
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--paper);
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--navy-deep);
      transition: background 0.18s ease;
    }
    .apply-btn:hover { background: var(--navy-deep); }

    /* ── 직인(원형 도장) ───────────────────── */
    .seal-wrap {
      position: absolute;
      right: clamp(14px, 4vw, 30px);
      bottom: clamp(14px, 4vw, 28px);
      width: 96px; height: 96px;
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: rotate(-7deg);
    }
    .seal-wrap svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }

    /* ── 간기(刊記)/푸터 ───────────────────── */
    .colophon {
      margin-top: clamp(48px, 8vw, 76px);
      padding-top: 18px;
      border-top: 3px double var(--ink);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      font-size: 11.5px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--ink-faint);
      font-family: var(--latin);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .colophon .ko { font-family: var(--serif); letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: none; }

    /* ── 반응형 ─────────────────────────────── */
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      body { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.85; }
      .cover-meta dl { grid-template-columns: 42% 58%; }
      .article { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; }
      .article .no { color: var(--navy); font-size: 0.95rem; }
      .vitae { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
      .vitae .yr { padding-bottom: 0; border-bottom: none; }
      .vitae .ev { padding-top: 4px; }
      .cta-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cta-grid > div:first-child { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .seal-wrap { width: 74px; height: 74px; }
      .toc li { grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; }
      .toc li .pg, .toc li .lead { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- 공통 데모바 -->
  <div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
    <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
    <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 02 · 정민 세무회계 — 1960년대 정부 정책 백서 스타일</span>
    <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
  </div>
  <div style="height:40px;"></div>

  <main class="document">

    <!-- 상단 분류표시 -->
    <div class="classmark">
      <span class="docno">정민세무 제2026-01호</span>
      <span class="grade">공개</span>
      <span>발행 2026. 03. 02.</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 표지 -->
    <header class="cover">
      <p class="issuer">정민 세무회계 사무소</p>
      <h1>
        세무 종합안내 백서
        <span class="en">Jeongmin Tax &amp; Accounting · White Paper</span>
      </h1>
      <div class="rule-pair" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p class="slogan">신고는 정확하게, 절세는 합법적으로.<br />납세자의 권리를 지키는 동행자.</p>

      <div class="cover-meta">
        <dl><dt>문서번호</dt><dd class="latin">JM-WP-2026-01</dd></dl>
        <dl><dt>분류</dt><dd>세무대리 · 회계 · 기장</dd></dl>
        <dl><dt>발행처</dt><dd>정민 세무회계 사무소</dd></dl>
        <dl><dt>소재지</dt><dd>서울특별시 강남구 테헤란로</dd></dl>
        <dl><dt>등록번호</dt><dd class="latin">세무사 제20-031-2487호</dd></dl>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 목차 -->
    <nav class="toc" aria-label="목차">
      <h2>목　차</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><a href="#ch1"><span class="chap">제1장</span><span class="title">업무 안내</span><span class="lead" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="pg">p.01</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="#ch2"><span class="chap">제2장</span><span class="title">세무사 약력</span><span class="lead" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="pg">p.03</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="#ch3"><span class="chap">제3장</span><span class="title">수임 절차</span><span class="lead" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="pg">p.04</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="#ch4"><span class="chap">제4장</span><span class="title">수임료 및 상담 신청</span><span class="lead" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="pg">p.05</span></a></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <!-- 제1장 업무 안내 -->
    <section class="chapter" id="ch1">
      <div class="chapter-head">
        <span class="kicker">Chapter Ⅰ — Scope of Service</span>
        <h2>제1장　업무 안내</h2>
        <p class="sub">본 사무소가 수행하는 세무대리 업무의 범위와 내용을 조항별로 정한다. 각 조의 세부 사항은 상담 시 납세자의 사정에 따라 조정될 수 있다.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="article">
        <div class="no">제1조 (종합소득세)</div>
        <div class="body">
          <p><strong>사업소득·근로·기타소득을 합산하여 신고하는 개인 납세자를 대리한다.</strong> 매년 5월 확정신고를 기준으로 하며, 성실신고확인 대상자는 6월까지 연장 적용한다.</p>
          <span class="clause" data-n="①">장부 작성 여부에 따라 간편장부·복식부기 신고를 구분하여 처리한다.</span>
          <span class="clause" data-n="②">경비 누락 점검 및 공제·감면 항목을 사전 검토하여 적정 세액을 산정한다.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="article">
        <div class="no">제2조 (법인세)</div>
        <div class="body">
          <p><strong>법인 사업자의 결산 및 법인세 신고·납부를 대리한다.</strong> 사업연도 종료일이 속하는 달의 말일부터 3개월 이내 신고를 원칙으로 한다.</p>
          <span class="clause" data-n="①">재무제표 작성, 세무조정계산서 작성 및 부속명세서 일체를 포함한다.</span>
          <span class="clause" data-n="②">가지급금·접대비 등 세무상 위험 항목을 상시 관리한다.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="article">
        <div class="no">제3조 (양도소득세)</div>
        <div class="body">
          <p><strong>부동산·주식 등 자산 양도에 따른 양도소득세를 산정하고 신고를 대리한다.</strong> 양도일이 속하는 달의 말일부터 2개월 이내 예정신고를 원칙으로 한다.</p>
          <span class="clause" data-n="①">1세대 1주택 비과세·장기보유특별공제 적용 여부를 사전 진단한다.</span>
          <span class="clause" data-n="②">취득가액 입증자료 검토를 통해 과세표준을 적정화한다.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="article">
        <div class="no">제4조 (기장대리)</div>
        <div class="body">
          <p><strong>사업자의 장부 작성 및 회계 기록을 월 단위로 대행한다.</strong> 매입·매출 증빙 관리, 부가가치세 신고, 원천세 신고를 포함한다.</p>
          <div class="ledger">
            <table class="gov">
              <caption>[표 1] 기장대리 업무 주기</caption>
              <thead>
                <tr><th>구분</th><th>주기</th><th>주요 처리 내용</th></tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><th>원천세</th><td>매월</td><td>급여대장 검토 · 원천징수 이행상황 신고</td></tr>
                <tr><th>부가가치세</th><td>분기 / 반기</td><td>매입세액 공제 점검 · 예정·확정 신고</td></tr>
                <tr><th>결산</th><td>연 1회</td><td>재무제표 작성 · 종합/법인세 신고 연계</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
